# Allowlist: ignore everything by default, then unignore the intended project files.
*

# Descend into any folder so the file types below are found at any depth.
!*/

!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md

# Typical project files: docs, manifests, config, scripts and images.
!*.md
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.json
!*.sh
!*.tpl
!*.txt
!*.toml
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.gif
!*.svg

# Secrets and local state stay excluded even though the types above are allowed.
.env
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
.aws/
.gcp/
.azure/
*credentials*.json
*-sa-key.json
*.secret.yaml
*.secret.yml

# Raw agent/session logs and tooling noise.
.claude/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
